10                                             # MC/DC for a chain that ends a grep, map, sort or value do block.  The
11                                             # block gives the chain a value context, so the outer operator is part of
12                                             # the decision, as it is under return.  The void chain before the end of
13                                             # a block is the control: it stays a branch.
